{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992030/extras/ef3e33c80aa0505e1d9f746c52bdac40.poster.avif?t=1758183406\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992030/extras/ef3e33c80aa0505e1d9f746c52bdac40.webm?t=1758183406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992030/extras/ef3e33c80aa0505e1d9f746c52bdac40.mp4?t=1758183406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Part 1: False Haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, you play as Luca \u2014 a young boy staying with his grandmother while his parents are away. What begins as a quiet night soon spirals into a surreal and terrifying experience. After a disturbing phone call, Luca starts questioning everything around him. Is his grandmother really who she says she is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you make it through the night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, narrative-driven psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design and immersive visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS-inspired aesthetic and UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time interaction via objects and puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Pick up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F - Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R -\u00a0In the blink of an eye</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ESC - Settings Menu<